highlights:
No tab-hopping across seven apps. Uhuru brings the work into one place — and one bill.
...
Specialised intelligence for the work that matters. Uhuru's specialised models go deeper into the domains where context, structure, risk, and judgment matter.
...
Generic AI gives broad answers. Uhuru's specialised models are built around the real workflows, documents, risks, and decisions inside each field.

From health communication to legal drafting, personalised education, biodiversity, genomics, and scientific research, Uhuru brings domain-focused intelligence into one connected AI platform.
...
The first AI built to reach every African — not only the ones with the latest phone and the fastest data.
...
Four ways in. One Uhuru.Web, WhatsApp, SMS and Voice — all routed to the same intelligence.
